NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

The electricity demand data used by this project is NOT covered by the MIT
licence and is not redistributed here. It is licensed separately under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):

  Mukherjee, Debanjan; Kalita, Karuna; Kumar, Subhash (2024),
  "Electricity Demand, Solar and Wind Generation Data
  (September 2021 - June 2025) of India at 1-hour interval",
  Mendeley Data, V2, doi: 10.17632/y58jknpgs8.2
  https://doi.org/10.17632/y58jknpgs8.2

Original data: Grid-India / NERLDC, Ministry of Power, Government of India.

CC BY 4.0 requires attribution when the data is reused. Anyone running this
pipeline downloads the data directly from Mendeley and is bound by that
licence, not this one.
